    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Description</b> : When the user accesses the password reset page through the reset password link and submits a valid new password, the system displays an <b>"Auth session missing"</b> error message instead of successfully resetting the password.</p>

<p><b>Steps to Reproduce :</b> <br/>
1. Click The Reset password Link.<br/>
2. Enter an Email<br/>
3. A Link will send your Email.<br/>
4. Click The Link.<br/>
5. Enter The Change Password and Confirm Password .<br/>
6. Click The Submit</p>

<p>*Expected Result : W*hen an user click the submit button the reset password will works successfully. The User should login with new Password .</p>

<p><b>Actual Result :</b>  There is an error “Auth Session Missing”</p>

